//! Controls nesting of named view-transition groups. Use containment to preserve ancestor effects
//! such as clipping during a transition; this has no effect when view-transition-name is none.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - contain: Establishes a container for descendant transition groups.
//! - nearest: Nests inside the nearest ancestor transition group, even without explicit containment.
//! - normal: Nests inside the nearest ancestor group that establishes containment, or the transition
//! root.
//!
//! Grammar: normal | contain | nearest | <custom-ident>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-view-transitions-2/#propdef-view-transition-group
//!
//! Author guide: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-view-transitions-2/#propdef-view-transition-group
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

